2045 0 obj
  << /ActualText (We successfully demonstrate that LLMs can automate the generation of domain instances that are not only syntactically flawless but also highly realistic\056 We validated two distinct prompting strategies\072 Instruction Learning \050IL\051 which provides a simple\054 efficient approach for producing high\055quality\054 realistic instances and Chain\055of\055Thought \050CoT\051\054 which leverages multi\055stage reasoning to explore diverse test scenarios\054 proving superior for model validation by producing less realistic\054 but larger and more structurally diverse instances that effectively identify potential model under\055specifications\056)
     /K [ 43 ]
     /P 2046 0 R
     /Pg 1959 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

